- The still-generation recipe used `gpt-image-2` with attached refs `docs/design/style-ref-1.png`, `docs/design/style-ref-2.png`, `docs/design/cast-board.png`, and `docs/design/object-board.png`; the style lock was flat sticker-sheet doodle, thick wobble black outlines, rounded simple forms, cornflower-blue background `#62b3f3`, tiny dot eyes, tiny centered two-stroke/comma nose, and no text, gradients, shadows, or perspective [Task 2]
- The stable character locks were seller = curly black-haired man in orange sweater and cream pants, BMH representative / Priya = headset woman with black back ponytail, orange/yellow headband, orange headset, yellow top, cream pants, and Andrea = narrator/company avatar only [Task 2]
- The recorded final 4B model policy was mixed: default `seedance_2_0`, override `b04b_offer: kling3_0`, override `b05_step5_close: seedance_2_0`; use the queue metadata and current-gate docs rather than memory when reconstructing the exact recipe [Task 2]
- Andrea and other narrator delivery should stay at HeyGen voice speed `1.0` / default speed; any guide, template, scene card, or script that still says `0.95` is stale and should be corrected before regeneration [Task 3][ad-hoc note]
- When an AI animation clip ends before the beat or transition ends, hold that clip's own extracted final frame; do not fall back to the source still and do not use forward/reverse loops [Task 4][ad-hoc note]

## Failures and how to do differently

- symptom: time gets wasted on the wrong lesson; cause: the lesson was inferred from nearby examples and 5A files were created before checking the requested target; fix: confirm the lesson code and locked-master cue range before making any file writes [Task 1]
- symptom: prompt extraction turns noisy and unreliable; cause: broad searches across session logs surface unrelated artifacts; fix: narrow to lesson-scoped docs, reviewed assets, queue metadata, and current-gate files first [Task 1][Task 2]
- symptom: a "replicate exactly" handoff still fails to reproduce the approved look; cause: only prompt text was handed off; fix: include refs, character locks, model policy, rejected-model reason, negative constraints, and finalizer requirements together [Task 2]
- symptom: queue metadata extraction fails or model policy is misread; cause: the queue JSON shape was assumed instead of inspected; fix: verify whether the wrapper stores entries under `clips` or `jobs` before iterating [Task 2]
- symptom: regenerated course narration sounds oddly slow; cause: stale templates still say Andrea speed `0.95`; fix: reset to HeyGen/default speed `1.0` unless Jarrad explicitly asks for a different delivery [Task 3][ad-hoc note]
- symptom: an animation ends early and the tail looks wrong; cause: the assembly falls back to a source still or loop trick; fix: hold the clip's own extracted final frame through the remaining beat/transition duration [Task 4][ad-hoc note]

