# Generate m17 L17 b02 role value scene asset

## Goal

Generate one course scene PNG at `course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b02_role-value.png`.

## Scope

- Use the attached BMH course doodle references and locked flat sticker-sheet style.
- Use gpt-image-2 through the built-in image generation workflow.
- Create one 1600 x 900 PNG.
- Show three different simple role cards with distinct abstract icons only: headset, clipboard, and small team.
- Connect those three role cards with black lines into one larger central value board.
- Keep the cards and board blank, with no writing.
- Keep generous clean cornflower-blue space above for code-rendered overlays.
- Avoid numbers, money, payout symbols, people, faces, text, words, letters, labels, ambient doodles, motion marks, random props, gradients, texture, shadows, lighting, and perspective depth.

## Verification

- Confirm the file exists at the requested path.
- Confirm the file is a PNG at 1600 x 900.
- Visually inspect for the requested three role cards, central value board, clean blue upper space, and no forbidden symbols or clutter.
- Check the saved PNG palette and background for the locked flat course colors.

