  - flat sticker-sheet doodle illustration
  - thick black hand-drawn outlines with slight wobble
  - rounded simple forms
  - flat fills only: yellow, orange, cream, white, black on cornflower-blue background `#62b3f3`
  - no gradients / texture / shadows / lighting / perspective / skin-tone shading
